        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Shore Things, Air Force, Incorporated\n- People: Rick Sebak, Enrique Piñeyro, Verónica Cura\n- Organizations: PBS, WQED Pittsburgh, Aqua Films\n\nFacts:\n- Shore Things is a 1996 PBS television documentary by Rick Sebak of WQED Pittsburgh.\n- Air Force, Incorporated is a 2006 Argentine documentary film whose Spanish title is \"Fuerza aérea sociedad anónima\".\n- Air Force, Incorporated was written and directed by Enrique Piñeyro.\n- Air Force, Incorporated was executive produced by Aqua Films' Verónica Cura and produced by Enrique Piñeyro.",
